% Package Options:  obeyspaces, hyphens, spaces, lowtilde
%
% Revision History:
% ver 1.1 6-Feb-1996:
% Fix hyphens that wouldn't break and ligatures that weren't suppressed.
% ver 1.2 19-Oct-1996:
